    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37305" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑξηκοστός</span></b>  (
			Aeol.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξήκοιστος</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>IG</u>
			11(4).1064b15
		</span></i>), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sixtieth,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.126
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑξηκοστή, ἡ,</span>
			<i>customs duty</i> or <i>tax of</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>/<i><span class="en">
				60
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i>).<i><span class="en">
				3
			</span></i>(Mytil.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PEleph.</u>
				14.11
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑξηκοστόν, τό,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>/<i><span class="en">
				60
			</span></i>
			<i>of a degree, second,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gem.
				18.7
			</span></i>; but, <i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>/<i><span class="en">
				60
			</span></i>
			<i>of a grand circle,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				16.6
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόκοι ἑ. ἐφ᾽ ἕτη δέκα</span> interest
				<i>at the rate of</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>/<i><span class="en">
				60
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				444.14
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Ilium</span>).</div>
